{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "sync-v1.7.0.4", "body": [{"from": 0.16, "to": 1.56, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "如果你还在苦练一次定位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 1.56, "to": 3.12, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "那你的瞄准大概率是练废了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 3.12, "to": 5.48, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "瓦的瞄准核心根本不是定", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 5.48, "to": 7.56, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "而是根这期的目接地来讲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 7.56, "to": 10.22, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "跟枪本期包含了关于跟枪的理解", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 10.22, "to": 11.72, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "知道跟枪的意义是什么", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 11.72, "to": 13.6, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "以及练习跟枪的一些项目", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 13.6, "to": 14.4, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "留下收藏", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 14.4, "to": 15.78, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "方便以后长期练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 15.78, "to": 17.14, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "首先来讲跟枪的意义", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 17.14, "to": 21.13, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "也就是为什么你只练一次定位会毁了你的瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 21.13, "to": 23.17, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "因此靠一次定位去瞄准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 23.17, "to": 25.49, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "一定不能保证百分百的精确", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.49, "to": 29.37, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "第一个你不能确定你在准星靠近目标头部时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 29.37, "to": 30.75, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "目标会不会移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 30.75, "to": 34.96, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "第二个你也不能确定你在一次定位这么快速的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 34.96, "to": 37.12, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "你能保证我开的那一枪就在人家头上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 37.12, "to": 39.32, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "如果全靠一次定位就能解决瞄准的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 39.32, "to": 40.58, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "那为什么你不去玩数位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 40.58, "to": 41.96, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "还要花2900去买个AK", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 41.96, "to": 43.76, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "所以我们需要跟枪微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 43.76, "to": 45.16, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "属于跟枪开火", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 45.16, "to": 47.48, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "别人移动把准星吸到别人头上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 47.48, "to": 49.23, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "也属于跟枪压枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 49.23, "to": 51.11, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "把子弹压在第一个点上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 51.11, "to": 52.56, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "至于为什么这些都是跟枪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 52.56, "to": 54.16, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "等我讲完跟枪的理解之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 54.16, "to": 55.64, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "你再回来思考这些问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 55.64, "to": 56.54, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "这里困难吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 56.54, "to": 59.16, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "演示的就是一次定位之后的微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 59.16, "to": 61.04, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "这属于一种跟枪动作", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 61.04, "to": 63.18, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "接下来讲跟枪的一些理解", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 63.18, "to": 65.039, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "跟枪是一个平滑的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 65.039, "to": 68.039, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "是一个不断去观察准星与目标位置", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 68.039, "to": 69.979, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "然后去做调整的过程", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 69.979, "to": 74.62, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "所以做好跟枪的第一个就是眼睛聚焦目标头部", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 74.62, "to": 76.54, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "持续捕捉目标运动轨迹", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 76.54, "to": 77.92, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "然后用余光找到准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.92, "to": 79.34, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "将两者位置相对比", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 79.34, "to": 80.52, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "最后进行调整", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 80.52, "to": 82.2, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "一直重复这些步骤", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 82.2, "to": 84.14, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "直到你的准星与头部重合", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 84.14, "to": 87.14, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "那这就必须让自己的准心保持灵活", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 87.14, "to": 88.38, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "准心要灵活", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 88.38, "to": 90.08, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "你的手部肌肉就要灵活", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 90.08, "to": 93.38, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "陀螺仪跟枪不要出现往死里抓手机的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 93.38, "to": 97.12, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "手指跟枪不要出现往死里摁屏幕的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 97.12, "to": 100.32, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "肌肉的用力收缩会使肌肉僵硬", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 100.32, "to": 101.6, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "导致肌肉不灵活", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 101.6, "to": 104.039, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "所以你才会出现跟不住枪的情况", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 104.039, "to": 105.919, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "好知道了上面一点之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 105.919, "to": 107.639, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "我们就要去想一个问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 107.639, "to": 110.66, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "怎么样才能保持准星与目标相对静止", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 110.66, "to": 113.52, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "那么你就要去观察谁在运动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 113.52, "to": 114.84, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "以什么速度运动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 114.84, "to": 118.24, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "比如现在我们在操控一个人物的移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 118.24, "to": 120.89, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "他对面目标静止", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 120.89, "to": 123.73, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "那想让准星保持在目标头上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 123.73, "to": 126.73, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "那我们就要去向我们移动的方向", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 126.73, "to": 128.37, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "反方向移动准星", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 128.37, "to": 130.21, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "并且保持人物相同的移速", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 130.21, "to": 131.12, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "能理解吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 131.12, "to": 133.92, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "假设瓦人物移动速度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 133.92, "to": 137.02, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "拿AK的人物移动速度是7米每秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 137.02, "to": 138.84, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "我们现在向左移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 138.84, "to": 142.52, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "那我们就要以7米每秒的速度向右移动准心", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 142.52, "to": 145.71, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "这样才能保持准星与头部相对静止", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 145.71, "to": 146.49, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "能理解吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 147.73, "to": 151.0, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "好OK接着当我们发现人物左移", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 151.0, "to": 152.9, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "准心在人物左边", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 152.9, "to": 154.5, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "而且时间越长", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 154.5, "to": 156.019, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "准心离头部越远", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 156.019, "to": 159.98, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "那可能准星移动的速度就没有达到7米每秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 159.98, "to": 161.82, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "你又要以更快的速度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 161.82, "to": 165.36, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "而不是力气去滑动屏幕或者陀螺仪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 165.36, "to": 167.4, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "所以这是需要我们练习的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 167.4, "to": 173.739, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "而且这也是再一次强调了眼睛捕捉目标和准星相对位置关系的重要性", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 173.739, "to": 174.859, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "好买号怕找回", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 174.859, "to": 175.699, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "卖号怕封号", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 175.699, "to": 176.359, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "无畏契约", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 176.359, "to": 178.86, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "桃号认准7881浏览器", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 178.86, "to": 180.2, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "搜7881平台", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 180.2, "to": 182.06, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "海量成品账号任君选购", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 182.06, "to": 183.86, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "AI加人工双重验号", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 183.86, "to": 185.38, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "估号逐渐核验审核", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 185.38, "to": 186.08, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "严格交易", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 186.08, "to": 187.88, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "全程直播包赔包售后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 187.88, "to": 190.07, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "数百万玩家的安心之选哇", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 190.07, "to": 193.95, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "如果你的准心是在移动过程中一直与头保持", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 193.95, "to": 195.63, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "比如说一厘米的距离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 195.63, "to": 196.85, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "但就是跟不上头", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 196.85, "to": 199.16, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "这种情况是你找到了7米每秒的速度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 199.16, "to": 201.47, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "也就是找到了人物的移动速度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 201.47, "to": 203.11, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "只是在开始移动的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 203.11, "to": 205.67, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "人物加速到7米每秒的时间", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 205.67, "to": 208.35, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "比你准心加速到7米每秒的时间要短", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 208.35, "to": 210.81, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "也就是更快达到7米每秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 210.81, "to": 212.57, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "所以才会出现偏差", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 212.57, "to": 216.41, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "你只需要从最开始准星从静止到7米每秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 216.41, "to": 217.91, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "这个加速的时间变短", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 217.91, "to": 220.01, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "就可以保持在目标头上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 220.01, "to": 224.91, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "或者当你发现准星与人物出现偏差了之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 224.91, "to": 226.34, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "你就要加速", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 226.34, "to": 228.24, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "可能是加速到10米每秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 228.24, "to": 230.26, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "20每秒的速度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 230.26, "to": 232.93, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "然后达到目标的右侧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 232.93, "to": 234.77, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "然后重新减速", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 234.77, "to": 235.89, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "回到7米每秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 235.89, "to": 238.65, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "就可以保持在他的头上", "music": 0.1138613805019203}, {"from": 240.35, "to": 245.01, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "好理解上面的内容之后来讲一下为什么你的跟枪一段一段的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 245.01, "to": 248.06, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "这是你没有去匀速运动的结果", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 248.06, "to": 251.8, "sid": 112, "location": 2, "content": "这就好像什么你踩油门加速只是踩一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 251.8, "to": 252.96, "sid": 113, "location": 2, "content": "你只是单纯踩一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 252.96, "to": 254.2, "sid": 114, "location": 2, "content": "然后松开踩一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 254.2, "to": 255.72, "sid": 115, "location": 2, "content": "然后松开他加速一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 255.72, "to": 256.44, "sid": 116, "location": 2, "content": "然后减速一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 256.44, "to": 256.84, "sid": 117, "location": 2, "content": "加速一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 256.84, "to": 257.74, "sid": 118, "location": 2, "content": "然后减速一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 257.74, "to": 260.36, "sid": 119, "location": 2, "content": "我们要做的是一直保持匀速", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 260.36, "to": 262.7, "sid": 120, "location": 2, "content": "就是踩一下油门踩住了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 262.7, "to": 263.66, "sid": 121, "location": 2, "content": "你脚不要松", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 263.66, "to": 264.43, "sid": 122, "location": 2, "content": "知道吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 264.43, "to": 265.55, "sid": 123, "location": 2, "content": "你可以不需要目标", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 265.55, "to": 267.37, "sid": 124, "location": 2, "content": "就单纯移动准心慢慢移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 271.05, "to": 272.87, "sid": 125, "location": 2, "content": "或者你也可以先加速", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 272.87, "to": 273.69, "sid": 126, "location": 2, "content": "速度非常快", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 273.69, "to": 275.13, "sid": 127, "location": 2, "content": "然后再缓慢减速", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 275.13, "to": 276.419, "sid": 128, "location": 2, "content": "减速的那段时间", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 276.419, "to": 278.059, "sid": 129, "location": 2, "content": "一定要让准星匀速运动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 278.059, "to": 279.739, "sid": 130, "location": 2, "content": "还有一种情况就是你的灵敏度太高了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 279.739, "to": 280.7, "sid": 131, "location": 2, "content": "你掌控不了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 280.7, "to": 281.72, "sid": 132, "location": 2, "content": "这个就不多讲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 281.72, "to": 283.58, "sid": 133, "location": 2, "content": "下一期会出调灵敏度的视频的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 283.58, "to": 286.45, "sid": 134, "location": 2, "content": "如果说大家想早一点看到视频的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 286.45, "to": 288.79, "sid": 135, "location": 2, "content": "就麻烦大家留下点赞和收藏吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 288.79, "to": 290.94, "sid": 136, "location": 2, "content": "大家越支持更新速度越快哦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 290.94, "to": 293.14, "sid": 137, "location": 2, "content": "保持好匀速之后去观察", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 293.14, "to": 294.26, "sid": 138, "location": 2, "content": "随着你的移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 294.26, "to": 296.34, "sid": 139, "location": 2, "content": "是准星离目标越来越远", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 296.34, "to": 299.44, "sid": 140, "location": 2, "content": "还是与目标保持着一段相同的距离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 299.44, "to": 302.99, "sid": 141, "location": 2, "content": "然后再回看刚才讲的内容去改善好吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 302.99, "to": 305.01, "sid": 142, "location": 2, "content": "OK前面的东西都理解了之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 305.01, "to": 306.85, "sid": 143, "location": 2, "content": "就可以进行一个思考了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 306.85, "to": 311.2, "sid": 144, "location": 2, "content": "开头为什么说压枪算跟枪的一种微调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 311.2, "to": 312.22, "sid": 145, "location": 2, "content": "也算跟枪的一种", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 312.22, "to": 314.8, "sid": 146, "location": 2, "content": "大家可以在评论区留下你的看法与见解", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 314.8, "to": 318.07, "sid": 147, "location": 2, "content": "现在来讲一下关于跟枪的一些练习项目", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 318.07, "to": 320.39, "sid": 148, "location": 2, "content": "近距离随机移动跟枪60秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 320.39, "to": 321.87, "sid": 149, "location": 2, "content": "一组组间休息20秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 321.87, "to": 323.23, "sid": 150, "location": 2, "content": "可以练习两组", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 323.23, "to": 326.11, "sid": 151, "location": 2, "content": "然后中距离跟枪60秒为一组练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 326.11, "to": 327.39, "sid": 152, "location": 2, "content": "两组组间休息20秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 327.39, "to": 328.55, "sid": 153, "location": 2, "content": "如果你觉得难度较低的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 328.55, "to": 332.32, "sid": 154, "location": 2, "content": "可以用手枪刀或者霓虹的疾跑来增加瞄准难度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 332.32, "to": 334.14, "sid": 155, "location": 2, "content": "然后远距离跟枪一样的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 334.14, "to": 335.04, "sid": 156, "location": 2, "content": "60秒为一组", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 335.04, "to": 336.71, "sid": 157, "location": 2, "content": "两组组间休息20秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 336.71, "to": 339.83, "sid": 158, "location": 2, "content": "这个距离如果准心一段一段移动没关系", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 339.83, "to": 342.08, "sid": 159, "location": 2, "content": "只要大概在投到附近就OK", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 342.08, "to": 344.9, "sid": 160, "location": 2, "content": "然后我们人物静止靶子移动60秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 344.9, "to": 346.689, "sid": 161, "location": 2, "content": "一组组间休息20秒", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 346.689, "to": 348.709, "sid": 162, "location": 2, "content": "两组近中远都要练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 348.709, "to": 350.09, "sid": 163, "location": 2, "content": "我这里就不演示了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 350.09, "to": 351.71, "sid": 164, "location": 2, "content": "最后一个项目靶子移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 351.71, "to": 352.77, "sid": 165, "location": 2, "content": "我们人物也移动", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 352.77, "to": 355.51, "sid": 166, "location": 2, "content": "找到那种准星粘在头上的感觉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 355.51, "to": 356.45, "sid": 167, "location": 2, "content": "这个比较难", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 356.45, "to": 357.57, "sid": 168, "location": 2, "content": "大家慢慢来就好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 357.57, "to": 358.91, "sid": 169, "location": 2, "content": "也是一分钟为一组", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 358.91, "to": 360.89, "sid": 170, "location": 2, "content": "组间休息20秒两组", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 360.89, "to": 363.51, "sid": 171, "location": 2, "content": "这一期关于跟枪的视频就讲到这里了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 363.51, "to": 366.31, "sid": 172, "location": 2, "content": "感谢大家长期以来对于我的支持与认可", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 366.31, "to": 369.58, "sid": 173, "location": 2, "content": "下一期视频我们来讲怎么找到属于自己的灵敏度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 369.58, "to": 371.32, "sid": 174, "location": 2, "content": "点赞和收藏数量越高", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 371.32, "to": 372.44, "sid": 175, "location": 2, "content": "更新速度越快哦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 372.44, "to": 373.62, "sid": 176, "location": 2, "content": "我们下期再见", "music": 0.0}], "bvid": "BV1xeN76rECh", "title": "只练一次定位会毁了你的瞄准【登赋阶梯】跟枪", "owner": "Pardon帕恩无畏契约手游", "duration": 374}